            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Ionosphere and Upper Atmosphere; ATMOSPHERIC PROCESSES: Atmospheric electricity, Lightning; SOLAR PHYSICS, ASTROPHYSICS, AND ASTRONOMY: X-rays, gamma rays, and neutrinos; SPACE PLASMA PHYSICS: Radiation processes</rdf:li>
